    "body": "Scope addition from the pre-review of PR #4507 (folded pane chips, #4503): the folded chip's warn glyph and its 4 px warn bar use `warn_ink` (230,170,60), which is 1.92:1 on the light chip ground (`ink_alt`), below the 3:1 floor for UI marks. When this PR replaces the warn ink with `status_warn`, include the fold chip (`crates/ui-kit/src/fold.rs`) and add a kit test that the chip's state mark clears 3:1 on its ground in both themes.\n",
